00:59:50.670 --> 00:59:57.190
<v Evan>Tolkien? I don't [BLEEP] with Tolkien at all. Yeah, no. No, that [BLEEP] was always too white for me.
<v Evan>“托尔金？我根本不看托尔金的东西。是啊，不。不，那些东西对我来说太‘白人化’了。”

00:59:57.190 --> 01:00:02.190
